  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Cyclone Joint Response 2023 (MZQJR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tropical Cyclone (TC) Freddy, the longest-lasting and most energetic tropical cyclone on record, hit Mozambique twice, on the 24th of February and then again on the 11th of March 2023. There are significant unmet acute food and WASH needs due to only few implementing humanitarian actors present in Caia. FH and CCM will implement an integrated program by providing life-saving food security and livelihood as well as WASH support to most affected Households (HHs).</narrative>
  </description>
